<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My Jesus, as Thou wilt!</l><l>Though seen through many a tear,</l><l>Let not my star of hope</l><l>Grow dim or disappear;</l><l>Since Thou on earth hast wept,</l><l>And sorrowed oft alone,</l><l>If I must weep with Thee,</l><l>My Lord, Thy will be done!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>My Jesus, as Thou wilt!</l><l>All shall be well for me;</l><l>Each changing future scene</l><l>I gladly trust with Thee.</l><l>Straight to Thy rest above</l><l>I travel calmly on,</l><l>And sing, in life or death,</l><l>My Lord, Thy will be done!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
